# Multi-page app — each route is a real static file (technology/index.html,
# etc.), and Cloudflare Pages' built-in pretty-URL resolution should already
# serve them at the clean path. These are explicit, scoped rewrites (200,
# not a redirect) as a safety net for the exact 4 known routes, so the
# no-trailing-slash URLs work even if that inference doesn't apply here.
# Deliberately NOT a wildcard: a genuinely missing path still 404s normally.
/technology    /technology/index.html    200
/delivery      /delivery/index.html      200
/capabilities  /capabilities/index.html  200
/contact       /contact/index.html       200
